  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture and Food Security Biosecurity Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agriculture and Food Security Biosecurity Program is addressing the increasing biosecurity threats facing agricultural industries in the Indo-Pacific.  The program coordinates and delivers initiatives that build the capacity of biosecurity organisations in neighbouring countries to prevent and respond to biosecurity threats that cause significant economic and environmental damage.  The program will also enhance trade and market access by facilitating and improving biosecurity arrangements between countries.  The program focusses on countries in the Pacific including Solomon Islands, Papua New Guinea, Vanuatu and Timor-Leste.</narrative>
  </description>
